## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-09-29. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam CDR Default (Roam)

- Items: Magic Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Fleeting Time, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Revitalize
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Athena's Shield over Antique Cuirass when Use against double-magic comps where burst magic damage lands before the front line can body-block it.; Guardian Helmet over Antique Cuirass when Use when map pressure is high and returning to base between fights would cost your team an objective.; Oracle over Immortality when Use when your ult shield value matters more than a revive, especially into sustained poke where Oracle's Bless passive keeps the frontline up.; Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when the enemy draft has layered hard CC and you need Fortitude to avoid being chain-stunned before pressing Time Journey.
- Total cost: 10910 gold

Standard ranked roam setup built around CDR, team-wide shield value, anti-heal coverage, and enough durability to survive after pressing Time Journey.

### Roam Magic Zoner (Roam)

